{"title":"Silver Rapier","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gaunt Ogre, Dune Elemental</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · STR 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (9 / 1,996 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-elemental\" title=\"Dune Elemental - Normal, 1.6% of recorded drops (1 / 62 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/77761b474a7384a1df3e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Elemental</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.6%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-rapier\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip on q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=ordinary\">Ordinary <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-rapier\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"corrode\">Corrosion</button></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Quality scales this item’s own stats. Damage below is the weapon alone, before your stats and enchantments.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\" id=\"gearQTable\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Quality</th><th>Stats</th><th>This item</th><th>vs Ordinary</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"gearQRows\"><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=inferior\" title=\"Show it at Inferior\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-inferior\" src=\"data/img/f02f4f5eda250757c7a7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-inferior\">Inferior</span></td><td>-30%</td><td>4–9.4 damage</td><td>-2.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=crude\" title=\"Show it at Crude\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-crude\" src=\"data/img/f02f4f5eda250757c7a7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-crude\">Crude</span></td><td>-20%</td><td>4.6–10.7 damage</td><td>-1.9 avg</td><td class=\"muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/silver-rapier?q=shoddy\" title=\"Show it at Shoddy\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-shoddy\" src=\"data/img/f02f4f5eda250757c7a7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"q-name q-shoddy\">Shoddy</span>